tent with the prior biopsy cavity  The stitched side is inked black  the specimen is serially section  and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast re excision  inferior deep margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of breast tissue that is oriented to the new surgical margin with a stitch  The stitched surface is otherwise unremarkable  but the side opposite the stitch displays a focally hemorrhagic and fibrous surface consistent with the prior biopsy cavity  The stitched surface is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned  and entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast re excision  inferior superficial  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm fragment of breast tissue with a stitch designating the new surgical margin  which is inked black  The surface with the stitch is otherwise unremarkable  but the opposite surface displays a fibrous focally hemorrhagic appearance consistent with a prior biopsy site  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL INFERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  INFERIOR DEEP MARGIN   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  INFERIOR SUPERFICIAL MARGIN   EXCISION , Unchecked.
