e  The specimen is inked as follows  posterior black  anterior blue  superior green  and inferior yellow  The specimen is sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm biopsy cavity  which abuts the anterior margin and is more than 1 0c m from the remaining margins  The biopsy cavity is hemorrhagic and surrounded by white  firm  ill defined tissue  1 5cm away from the biopsy cavity  there is an additional REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm ill defined  firm area  abutting the inferior margin  In addition there are multiple dilated ducts  measuring up to 0 8cm in diameter  with necrotic tissue in the lumen  There is also a REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan skin ellipse on the anterior surface  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Firm away from biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section away from biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of skin on anterior lateral surface  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin  medial half cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm aggregate of fibrofatty soft tissue slices  entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin  lateral half cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unoriented fatty soft tissue  sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinal node  left axilla   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fatty firm soft tissue  The fat is dissected off  One lymph node  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  is bisected and submitted entirely in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   An additional node  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  is bisected and su